# --- runtime state, captures and models (local only; regenerate at runtime) ---
# The default espeak voice's cooked phrases SHIP with the repo (tiny, and the
# app must speak out of the box); the piper models and the other voices'
# phrases/samples are generated on the target machine - see the README note.
2026 attempt/chess-robot-v3/data/voices/*
!2026 attempt/chess-robot-v3/data/voices/phrases/
2026 attempt/chess-robot-v3/data/voices/phrases/*
!2026 attempt/chess-robot-v3/data/voices/phrases/espeak/
2026 attempt/chess-robot-v3/data/voice_samples/
